    {
      "number": 1223,
      "text": "He brought their hearts together[39], even if you had spent all that is on earth, you could not have brought their hearts together, but Allah has brought them together, for He is All-Mighty, All-Wise.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 8,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الأَنفَالِ",
